{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-13_beg","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":250,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-13_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-13","storyName":"不曾遗忘","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"Mon3tr结束了变异裂兽的痛苦，三人决定回研究所。Mantra在村庄中确认了圣愚的存在，以及它与内卫之间的联系。她似乎找到了打破困境的关键。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-13_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-12","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["科谢尼娅","Mon3tr","Mantra","忽近忽远的声音","Raidian","别乔克","疲倦的矿工","阿洛伊泽","娜迦"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"40","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":8},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_bg_66_g6_magnetofluidwaterfall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"13","text":"......"},"2":{"id":"13","text":"......"}},"values":[],"id":12},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":13},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"15","text":"它是不是......"},"2":{"id":"15","text":"不动了？"}},"values":[],"id":14},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":15,"end":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":16},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":17,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"好像......是的。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"吼声，还有那种粗重的呼吸声都消失了，是我们的攻击对它起作用了吗？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"可它还站着，没有倒下——","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"你们先不要动！我过去看看。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","loop":"true","channel":"w1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w1","fadetime":"0.5","id":29},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr确认两人所在的位置安全后，独自向前走去。","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"数秒前还形容癫狂的裂兽，此时已经被削去了部分体表的源石。它异常安静地站立着，就连奇怪的前肢也垂下，凝滞在身前。","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr小心翼翼地朝它靠近。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"她观察着这只裂兽，原本危险的野兽，躯体上发生的畸变使它看上去诡异万分。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"是因为源石的影响，身体在急速向“人类”的方向转变......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"一定很痛苦吧......","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":38},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":39},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":41},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":43},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"45","text":"Mon3tr，小心！"},"2":{"id":"45","text":"它又动了！"}},"values":[],"id":44},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":45,"end":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"呃——","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"但预想中的攻击并未发生。裂兽没有移动，而是沉重地、毫无征兆地向前倒下——","id":49,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_fall","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"直到它的四肢重新接触大地。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#9$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":59},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"61","text":"......Mon3tr，我认为我们应该趁这个机会离开。"},"2":{"id":"61","text":"离开这里，回研究所。就现在。"}},"values":[],"id":60},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":61,"end":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"不，博士。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":65},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"67","text":"Mon3tr？"}},"values":[],"id":66},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":67,"end":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_breathe","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"它背上甚至还有起伏，它还在呼吸！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"而且它听上去......很痛苦？我不知道。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我没有阿米娅那种感受他人情绪的能力，更何况它还只是一只变异的动物，但......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#9$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我知道就算不管它，把它留在这里，它也会死。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"源石已经刺穿它的喉咙，它全身没有一处不痛，想把自己已经变异的器官都抓出来却没有能力。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"或许这也是之前它为什么会攻击我们。它没办法控制自己。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":79},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"81","text":"那就结束它的痛苦吧。"}},"values":[],"id":80},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":81,"end":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"对。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#3$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"不，没错。我能做到。我能......","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"结束它的痛苦。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":90},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","loop":"true","channel":"w1","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":93},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w1","fadetime":"0.5","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"她继续走向倒下的野兽，停在它的近侧，用爪子紧紧贴住一块少有结晶的皮毛。","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr望着裂兽，打量它的身体，眼底只有异样的平静。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"然后，她以做微创手术般精准利落的动作，掐灭了变异裂兽最后的、断续的喘息。","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"......我们走吧，博士。","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"回研究所。","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":107},{"type":"imgeffect","name":"$ib_screendistortion","image":"66_i09","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":110},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":111,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra保持着聆听。","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"她深知自己视野中的景象已不再可信，无论它是遭到了有意的扭曲，还是意外地反映了真实。","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"于是她听着，直到人群之中，最后一句祷词如同第一片雪花落下。","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"圣愚......","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"“迦弗里伊尔”。","id":116},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我在听。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":119},{"type":"subtitle","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"那就停下。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"停止——","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"这一切！","id":124},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我无权停止，因它从未开始。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":127},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你所见，只是你所想。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":128},{"type":"subtitle","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"于是Mantra不再尝试沟通。她向前一步，试图将那颤动着的红、白、黑色线条稳定下来。","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"然而就在她伸手的瞬间——","id":132},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"imgeffect","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......！","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忽近忽远的声音","text":"——Mantra——","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"image","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#2$1","id":145},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"Mantra！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#6$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......什么？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":151,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#5$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你刚才一动不动。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"我从没见过你这样......你怎么了？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#3$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"你们没有听见？","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#4$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"听见什么？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"年长的女人没有立刻回答。","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"她环视四周，发现留下的矿工姿态并不像先前那样如出一辙。这发现令她皱起眉头，又看向自己身旁。","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#10$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"阿洛伊泽在哪儿？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9E/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"她听了我的话，跑出去了。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"所以，至少你刚才确实有叫我们离开。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#5$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"是，但我一点也不记得我为什么要喊你们离开......这太奇怪了。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"精神类源石技艺。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#4$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你确定吗？我们专门为此训练过，如果受到这类攻击，我不会毫无防备。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#4$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"Raidian，检查自己的短期记忆是否遭到了干扰。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"哪种干扰？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#4$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我能造成的干扰。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"有次我让Mechanist忘了去找你是要借用“小树”和“小轴”的事，本质上不是抹除了那段记忆，而是阻断了记忆的形成。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#4$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"我记得......那是你第一次尝试像这样使用自己的源石技艺？大脑内的信息没有被成功储存就会造成记忆缺失，也就是遗忘。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"没错，来自你的提议。在对人体电信号的了解和利用上，你远比我更有经验。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#2$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你觉得这里有人能跟你使用一样的源石技艺？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"无法确定，也可能我只是比你们看到、听到了更多。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#5$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"怎么说？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#4$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"Raidian，乌萨斯的圣愚可能在这里。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#4$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"圣愚？为什么突然提起——","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#2$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"圣愚在这里？可乌萨斯仅存的圣愚，两年前就已经在圣骏堡被烧死了，这么短的时间之内，有可能诞生另一个圣愚吗？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我不知道。这是我接下来要去确认的。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#2$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"如果真是圣愚，如果它隐藏在队伍里，一路上我却什么都没发现......那就太危险了。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"我会让其他人保持警戒，你也注意安全。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"这危险不是物理上的，至少暂时不是。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"如果需要，我会及时求助。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#2$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"别忘了。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","text":"","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra转身，迈向数秒前那红色曾经存在的位置。","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"路上，不断有拥挤着靠在一起的矿工为她让出路来，或向她伸出手去。","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"女士，您想找......谁？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"我们还会，离开，去圣骏堡，是不是？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"我们会，活、活下去......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"（点头）","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"可他们，好像，不想离开？我也问了，毕扬叔叔。他不想离开。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"他宁愿，让创口，烂掉，也......不愿再、再逃了。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"可是，活着......难道不比，其他所有事，都重要吗？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#2$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"您，不说话......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲倦的矿工","text":"陌生人。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲倦的矿工","text":"你要去见娜迦，是不是？那你该膝行过去，仰着头瞧她。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲倦的矿工","text":"看着她，忏悔，然后得到宽恕。很快你就会发现从前不断挣扎、始终无法得到平静的自己，简直算得上是愚蠢。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra不置可否。她没有使用源石技艺与这些人对话，只是颔首，而后目不转睛地盯着房间深处，与他们错身。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲倦的矿工","text":"你会明白的......等到她跟前，你就会明白的。","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"屋内尽头，在其他人眼中佝偻而渺小的灰白身影正静静坐着，仿佛一尊塑像。","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_bg_66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#11$1","duration":"0.5","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"——圣愚？！","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#5$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"这不可能。绝不可能！圣愚已经死了！","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"当初陛下出于仁慈，在定罪前允许那个疯子为自己的罪行进行辩护。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"结果整整七天！整整七天他滴水未进，只为一刻不停地发表诡辩，拖延时间。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"当时他甚至还胆敢站在帝国议会的中央，对每一个走进来旁听的人说——","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#8$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"“我原谅你”！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"最后陛下忍无可忍，亲自宣判了他的死刑，但仍有被他蛊惑的信众去劫法场，进而爆发了近十年来发生在圣骏堡城区内最大的一场骚乱。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你说的这些事我们都知道。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"......","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1966_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#5$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"问题在于，如果Mantra说那是圣愚，一定是因为对方露出了可供揣摩的痕迹。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"我们要做的只是保护好自己，然后等待她的消息。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra并未像先前矿工说的那样俯下身去。","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"她踏进背光的阴影里，直视前方，仿佛眼前是一双回望的眼瞳。","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我知道，你能“听见”。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$kjerag_n_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_bat_kjerag_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":282,"musicid":3},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我听见，你饱含疑问。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":285},{"type":"subtitle","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"希望你不是只会模仿我的源石技艺和说话方式，圣愚。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"“圣愚”......如果你需要我是这个名字。","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"请解释这句话的含义。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"迦弗里伊尔、索洛米达、贝斯梅特、阿芙罗拉、娜迦......又或者，“圣愚”。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"所有这些，我是。","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......告诉我，你为什么要混入这些受苦的人当中？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"因为，这是一场布道。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"我将行遍这片广袤的土地，为了赎去人们遭受的苦。","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"也因为，我看见了她，听见了她。","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"我为她的痛苦所挽留，也因此驻足。","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"“她”是谁？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"一个受苦的灵魂。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"你诱骗她，让她称你为“娜迦”？","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"我从未诱骗。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"谎言。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"她像你一样提问，我像我一般回答。","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"仅此而已。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"没有意义的回答。你究竟是什么？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"你也看到我。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我看到无序的虚影。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"是的，我是。","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"但在其他人眼中，你不是。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"解释。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"世人看到的我的模样，只反映了他们对我的认知和期待。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"我以为，在所有灵魂当中，只有你会理解我为何如此存在。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"毕竟......","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"你是那个未完成的塑像，你曾会成为——","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"“我”。","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra紧紧盯住眼前诡异的虚影，却不确定自己能否从那上面看出任何有助于自己判断的信息。","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"很久以前，你曾剥除过一块黑色的腐肉。","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"我也一样。它追赶我，我驱逐它，像在呼吸之间从身上割下一块腐肉。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"荒谬的比喻。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"不。这只是简单的道理。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"如果它已经腐烂，不再与你身体的其他部分同气连枝......","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"那又为何还要保留？","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_8_29.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......这是......","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_66_i01.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"你的记忆？","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_66_i02.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CA/Avg_66_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"image","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":380},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"但也是我——","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#10$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"不。内卫......你能影响内卫，你当然也能影响那些矿工。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9E/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜迦","text":"你杀死它。你成为我。","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"如果这是我们之间唯一共通的地方，那么......","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#6$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"“身体”“腐肉”。你与内卫的关系——圣愚是内卫实验的源头。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"从颤动着的虚影之中，不再有声音传来。既不辩驳，也不肯定。","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra开始后退，离开了阴影的边缘。","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","id":399},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......Raidian，我需要支援。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"我在。","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"已确认先前的推测。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"另外，补充信息......","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"圣愚隐藏在矿工之中，帮助他们杀死了内卫。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"......我明白了。","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你需要我们怎么做？","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我需要你继续想办法联络罗德岛在乌萨斯其他地区的支援队伍，同时请阿米娅拖住阿洛伊泽。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我们现在不能马上离开这里，至少在我找到能唤醒矿工们的办法之前不行。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"让极境留在我的源石技艺使用范围之内，我可能会需要他的帮助。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你想做什么？","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"解除圣愚施加在矿工们身上的影响。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你认为是圣愚控制了这些矿工，让他们拒绝离开？","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"没错。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#4$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我们无法直接杀死圣愚，但它却随时可以杀死这里的每一个人。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"......也许阿米娅能帮忙。","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"也许可以，但阿米娅并不了解圣愚。我不希望她一无所知地卷入其中。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"圣愚与我的能力多有相似，这也是为什么只有我能做出这样的判断。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"它依靠他人的认知建立自身，我需要找到使它建立起“娜迦”这个身份的关键，然后才能解除圣愚施加的影响。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6A/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"你有怀疑的对象了。","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#2$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......没错。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":437},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#9$1","duration":"1.5","id":440},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"Mantra将视线投向四周的矿工，最后落到正从自己身旁经过，走向圣愚的女孩身上。","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"她茫然地呢喃着，惶惑而悲伤。","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#3$1","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我只是需要时间确认。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_4204_mantra_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":450},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":451},{"type":"image","id":452},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":453}],"characters":["科谢尼娅","Mon3tr","Mantra","忽近忽远的声音","Raidian","别乔克","疲倦的矿工","阿洛伊泽","娜迦"]}